      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A NES demake of Desertbus, or at least as close as Redslash12 can get. \r\n\r\nNESertBus features the familiar Desert Bus driver seat view but with classic sidescrolling gameplay. Includes Desert Bus staples such as the bus stop, the bug splat, and the unending grind along a straight road with a slight drift to the right."
